                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [(0.5,0,0.5),(0.5,0.5,0)]
            and the four points of the right-hand side [(0.5,0,0.5),(0,0.5,0.5),(1,0,0),(0.5,0.5,0)], which are different convex subsets of the 2-simplex (triangle).
